<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments Inc.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens analyst Dan Niles said he raised his earnings estimats on Texas Instruments Inc based on the company's second quarter earnings report, which beat consensus analyst estimates by 23 percent.</p>
<p>-- Niles said he raised his fiscal 1997 estimate to $4.25 per share from $3.75 previously and his 1998 estimate to $6.25 from $6. He raised his price target to $150 by the end of the year.</p>
</text>
